    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ header file with declarations for the µTest++ exception-checking functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header provides the declarations for the exception-checking facilities of the µTest++ framework. It exposes three function templates — <computeroutput>throws&lt;Exception_T&gt;()</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>throws()</computeroutput>, and <computeroutput>nothrow()</computeroutput> — which allow test cases to verify that a callable throws a specific exception, throws any exception, or throws no exception, respectively.</para>
<para>All declarations are conditionally compiled under <computeroutput>__cpp_exceptions</computeroutput> and reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file is included by <computeroutput><ref refid="micro-test-plus_8h" kindref="compound">micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus.h</ref></computeroutput>, which is the header that the applications include. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
